### Budget Overview


### ============================================


### Get Budget Remaining (Current Month)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/remaining HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

# Targeting arrives ONLY via the signed act_as claim (gateway edge mints it
# after validating ?user_id=). A raw ?user_id= sent direct-to-downstream is
# ignored: the response is always the JWT sub's data unless act_as is
# present with admin scope (then act_as wins).


