### ============================================


### Admin Backfill (per-user legacy conversion)


### ============================================
# Requires an ADMIN-scoped gateway JWT (log in as an admin user via the
# gateway, then paste that JWT as @jwt). Non-admin JWT -> 403, no JWT -> 401.
# ?user_id omitted = backfill your own rows; supplied = backfill that user.
# dry_run=true counts legacy rows without mutating - always check first.

### Backfill Dry-Run (self, expect counts, no mutation)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?dry_run=true HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### Backfill Execute (self)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### Backfill Dry-Run for Another User ff378c7b-e785-4994-8be3-a5586228f1d5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?dry_run=true&user_id=ff378c7b-e785-4994-8be3-a5586228f1d5 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### Backfill Execute for Another User

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?user_id={user_id} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### Backfill via Gateway (admin session cookie, expect 200 + proxied JWT)

POST {{gateway}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?dry_run=true HTTP/1.1


### Backfill with Non-Admin JWT (expect 403)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?dry_run=true HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### Backfill with Bad user_id (expect 400)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/admin/backfill?user_id=not-a-uuid HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### ============================================
### Identity contract (expect 401s without a valid JWT)
### ============================================

### Spoof attempt: bare X-User-ID, no JWT (expect 401)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/
X-User-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Garbled JWT on a user route (expect 401)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_EXPIRED_OR_GARBLED_JWT_HERE


